// RA5 fixture: the economy of the RA4 fixture (below) with the ore of RA5: the miners carry 20
// and 40 bails and take one from a cell after every 4 ticks of work, a refinery pays 25 for a
// bail of ore and 50 for a bail of gems, and the sale of an Allied refinery returns 90 credits
// whatever the refund rule gives (240). Fixture data (invariant I10).
//
